: We'll be in Montreal, Toronto and Vancouver for two weeks. We're playing eight gigs in total. After that, we'll have a five-day break, followed by a series of shows in Europe.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds exhausting! Do you sometimes get tired of being constantly on the road?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: I love this life! I'm naturally quite reserved, but when I get on stage, I become a totally different person.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How so?", "id": 2, "time": "27250", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>:  Playing gives me a chance to be more daring. I guess I'm more fearless behind my saxophone!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's like me and my articles! It allows me to be curious about everything. Actually, would you mind if I write a profile on you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: It would be a pleasure! My schedule is free tomorrow morning.", "id": 3, "time": "39500", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}